ription":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 11.","published":"2026-11-15T13:13:29.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50480953/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-11-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No. 2 Utah survives, stays unbeaten on late 70-yard TD in thriller vs. Arizona","description":"In a back-and-forth thriller, Utah rallied to remain undefeated after Devon Dampier hit Creed Whittemore on a 70-yard score late in a 40-39 win over Arizona.","published":"2026-11-15T14:23:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50488650/no-2-utah-survives-late-70-yard-td-thriller-vs-arizona","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Patience starting to run thin for head coaches in Week 11","description":"Saturday didn't offer much to change the season's complexion, but some coaches are coming under pressure.","published":"2026-11-15T08:17:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedayfinal111426/week-11-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-15T07:48:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions111426/cfp-predictions-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kiffin understands frustration as LSU's playoff hopes dashed","description":"LSU coach Lane Kiffin said it was fair to question the team's 6-4 record this season after losing to Texas on Saturday, a defeat that likely knocked LSU out of playoff contention.","published":"2026-11-15T08:55:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50488081/kiffin-understands-frustration-lsu-playoff-hopes-dashed","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Arch Manning leads game-winning drive as Texas stuns LSU","description":"Arch Manning found Raleek Brown for a 4-yard touchdown pass along the left sideline with 3 seconds left as Texas escaped Tiger Stadium with a victory over LSU","published":"2026-11-15T13:13:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50487515/arch-manning-leads-game-winning-drive-texas-stuns-lsu","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest's post-blowout jab at SMU tops college football Week 11 trolls","description":"Wake Forest dominated SMU on the gridiron Saturday -- and added insult to injury after the game.","published":"2026-11-15T05:30:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481104/college-football-trolls-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the winningest college football coaches of all time?","description":"From Saban to Paterno, there are many legendary college football coaches. Who has the best career record? Check out who has the most wins now.","published":"2026-11-15T04:25:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/39283806/who-winningest-college-football-coaches-all","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Louisville's win vs. UNC ends in brawl as Belichick helps restore order on field","description":"Louisville's 16-14 win at North Carolina ended with punches thrown and players spilling onto the field, prompting Bill Belichick to help pull players from the melee.","published":"2026-11-15T14:18:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486992/louisville-holds-unc-game-ends-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kentucky's CFP hopes take hit in upset loss to Gators, Philo","description":"Florida quarterback Aaron Philo had 221 all-purpose yards and a touchdown to rally the Gators past No. 11 Kentucky 21-14 Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T08:00:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486400/kentucky-cfp-hopes-take-hit-upset-loss-gators-philo","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4899484/andrew-rappleyea","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Rappleyea"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Andrew Rappleyea","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Rappleyea","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:22Z","intro":"Andrew Kenneth Rappleyea (born February 22, 2004) is an American college football tight end for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Rappleyea grew up in Millbrook, New York, and initially attended Our Lady of Lourdes High School. He transferred to Milton Academy in Milton, Massachusetts after his sophomore year. While at Milton Academy, Rappleyea boarded in Wolcott House for all of his three years. Rappleyea caught 27 passes for 517 yards in nine games during his junior season. As a senior he had 23 catches for 499 yards and six touchdowns.\nRappleyea was rated a four-star recruit and one of the top tight end prospects in the 2023 recruiting class. He originally committed to play college football at Michigan over offers from Penn State, Ohio State, Wisconsin, Wake Forest, and North Carolina. Rappleyea later flipped his commitment to Penn State."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Rappleyea played in three games while he redshirted his true freshman season at Penn State. He started the season opener of his redshirt freshman season, but suffered a season-ending injury in the game."}]}}